# Go build artefacts
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.test
*.out
/bin/
/dist/
# A `go build ./internal/.../gen` run from the repo root drops its binary
# here as plain `gen` — all three generators are package main in a directory
# called gen. Root-anchored, so the internal/*/gen SOURCE trees stay tracked.
/gen

# Coverage
*.cover
coverage.txt
coverage.html

# Node / frontend
node_modules/

# Wails build outputs
app/build/bin/
app/frontend/dist/
app/frontend/node_modules/

# Superpowers scratch state
.superpowers/

# OS cruft
.DS_Store

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PRIVATE FIXTURES — personal radio backups and serial captures.
# These contain callsigns and personal channel data and must NEVER be
# committed. Raw captures belong in a fixtures-private/ directory only;
# anything checked in must first be redacted (see docs/fixtures.md).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/fixtures-private/
*.[Mm][Ee][Mm][Ll][Ii][Ss][Tt]
[Mm][Ee][Mm][Oo][Rr][Yy]*.[Dd][Aa][Tt]
*.private-capture
